{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JER","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"耶利米书","commonName":"耶利米书","title":"耶利米书","order":24,"numberOfChapters":52,"sha256":"7cfd0f7ede9e6a98b1932bc84ae1a61e5449ad0039f95ebeb439ffee3b4ebab4","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/1.json","lastChapterNumber":52,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/52.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1352},"chapter":{"number":9,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["唯愿我的头是水泉，",{"text":"眼是泪泉，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好为我被杀的同胞昼夜哭泣；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"唯愿我在旷野有栖身之处，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以便远离我的同胞，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为他们是一群不忠不贞之徒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“他们鼓舌如簧，射出谎言，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"遍地充满诡诈，毫无诚实；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们行恶不断，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不认我是上帝。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们要提防邻居，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要信赖弟兄，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为弟兄都诡计多端，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"邻居个个满口是非。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们彼此欺骗，不说真话；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们说谎成性，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不知疲倦地肆意犯罪；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们充满暴力和诡诈，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不肯认识我。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"因此，万军之耶和华说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“看啊，我要熬炼、试验我这些罪恶的子民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"除此之外，我还有什么选择？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们舌如毒箭，说话诡诈，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"对邻居口蜜腹剑。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"难道我不该惩罚他们吗？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"难道我不该报应这样的民族吗？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"我要为众山痛哭哀号，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"为旷野的草场唱哀歌，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为那里一片荒凉，杳无人迹，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"听不见牲畜的叫声，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"飞鸟和走兽也逃去无踪。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华说：“我要使耶路撒冷沦为废墟，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"成为豺狼出没之地；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要使犹大的城邑荒凉，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不见人烟。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["谁有智慧明白这事呢？谁曾受过耶和华的指教可以讲解这事呢？为什么这片土地被毁，变得荒凉、杳无人迹？"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["耶和华说：“这是因为他们弃绝我赐给他们的律法，不听从我的话，不遵守我的律法，"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["执迷不悟，随从他们祖先的教导去供奉巴力。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["因此，以色列的上帝——万军之耶和华说：“看啊，我要使这百姓吃苦艾，喝毒水；"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["我要把他们分散到他们及其祖先都不认识的列国；我要使敌人挥刀追杀他们，直到灭绝他们。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"text":"万军之耶和华说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“你们听好了，把陪哭的妇人请来，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"把最会哭的妇人带来，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"叫她们速来为我的子民哀哭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"哭得他们泪盈满眶，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"哭得他们泪如泉涌。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为从锡安传出哀鸣，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"‘我们竟然灭亡了！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我们受了奇耻大辱！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我们的家园被毁，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我们只好背井离乡。’”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"妇人啊，你们要听耶和华的话，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"接受祂口中的教诲；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们要教导女儿哀哭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"教导邻居唱挽歌。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为死亡从窗户爬进我们的城堡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"吞灭街上的孩童和广场上的青年。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要宣告耶和华的话：“人们必尸横遍野，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像散布在田野上的粪便，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又像收割者身后没有收集的禾捆。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":["耶和华说：“智者不要夸耀自己的智慧，勇士不要夸耀自己的力量，富人不要夸耀自己的财富。"]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":["若有人夸耀，就让他夸耀自己认识我是耶和华，知道我喜欢在地上凭慈爱、公平和正义行事。这是耶和华说的。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":["耶和华说：“看啊，时候将到，我要惩罚所有只在身体上受过割礼的人，"]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":["就是埃及人、犹大人、以东人、亚扪人、摩押人和所有住在旷野、剃了鬓发的人，因为这些人都没有受过真正的割礼，以色列全家也没有受过内心的割礼。”"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/9.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/10.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/8.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":26}